# netlist of sch_feedback.sch, from schnet
part C301 capacitor value 10uF swap 1,2 name bulk
part J301 bnc value BNC name out
part R301 resistor value 1k swap 1,2 name rin
part R302 resistor value 10k swap 1,2 name rfb
part U301 ti/lmh6609 value LMH6609 pins in+:3,in-:2,out:6,v+:7,v-:4 name u
net +5V global C301.1 U301.7
net -5V global U301.4
net GND global C301.2 U301.3
net IN global R301.2
net u.in- R301.1 R302.1 U301.2
net u.out J301.1 R302.2 U301.6
